    {
      "en": ": If he had done something truly unforgivable, I don’t believe so.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whatwedo33",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whatwedo33.webp",
      "alt": "whatwedo33"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m...pretty sure it wasn’t anything like that...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can remember...talkin’ to him outside and then...comin’ in here...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And my minds been all sorts’a screwed up lately. You know that.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe it was me?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kinda wish I’d remembered what happened if that were the case, though.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": 'Ve'eard 'bout blackout drinkin' before, but never knew'it'd 'appen'tis quickly.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You still lasted much longer than I would.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, well...you’re a special case.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you really feel no pain at all, Emerald Guardian? Not even the slightest bit?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whatwedo34",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whatwedo34.webp",
      "alt": "whatwedo34"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not from anything I didn’t do to myself, I don’t think.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just...not sure what to say to Sir now.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not mad about what he did to you?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whatwedo35",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whatwedo35.webp",
      "alt": "whatwedo35"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well’ats exactly th’problem.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t wanna get mad too quickly if I played’a part in it.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": S’a different story if’e just wanked one off while I was sleeping...but I feel like it’s more’ten that.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or at least I hope it’s more.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Beatin’ off on a sleepin’ girl’s a pretty shite quality in a person.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You think he might have beaten you?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whatwedo36",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whatwedo36.webp",
      "alt": "whatwedo36"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No...Kendo Princess...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I ‘tink it might’a been something sexual.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I assumed that much, but I thought your heart was already possessed by the warlock Nithhala.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can multiple people hold dominion over the same organ at once?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, but...I don’t know if I’d say that’s what’s goin’ on here.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t wanna bog ya down by talkin’ about it when I know’it makes ya flustered, but I’ve talked to Sir about stuff like that recently.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And since I’ve already been playin’ around with the idea of maybe divin’ in’ta that sorta’ting...I just think this might be...my fault.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whatwedo37",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whatwedo37.webp",
      "alt": "whatwedo37"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will respect your outlook. But I do not believe anything could possibly be your fault if you were not even conscious to be at fault for it.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But what if I was’en then just...conked out? That’s why I’ve gotta talk to Sir.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But damn if I ain’t gonna be scarlet bringin' that up to’im.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You...wouldn’t happen ta know where he ran off to, would’ya?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Somewhere else.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I asked him to leave this place at once.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But he did not seem to be himself when he agreed, so it is possible he may have ignored that command entirely.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahh, shite.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It might be best to wait until another day then. Dad always said to not make important decisions while’yer on a tear.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I did not notice any tears in your costume. Your father would be proud.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No’e wouldn’t, Kendo Princess.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No’e wouldn’t...",
